        <description>At 809 PM EDT, Doppler radar was tracking a strong thunderstorm 8
miles east of Snipesville, or 9 miles southwest of Graham, moving
north at 15 mph.

HAZARD...Wind gusts around 40 mph.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Gusty winds could knock down tree limbs and blow around
unsecured objects.

Locations impacted include...
Hazlehurst.
</description>
