        <description>At 815 PM EDT, Doppler radar was tracking a strong thunderstorm near
Riverside, or near Moultrie, moving northeast at 25 mph.

HAZARD...Wind gusts up to 40 mph.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Gusty winds could knock down tree limbs and blow around
unsecured objects.

Locations impacted include...
Moultrie, Omega, Norman Park, Riverside, Schley, Berlin, Funston,
Ellenton, Cool Spring, Pineboro, Autreyville, Center Hill, Spence
Airport, South Moultrie, Moultrie Municipal A/P, Crosland, Bay, and
Murphy.
</description>
        <instruction>If outdoors, consider seeking shelter inside a building.</instruction>
