        <senderName>NWS Reno NV</senderName>
        <headline>Special Weather Statement issued July 30 at 5:25PM PDT by NWS Reno NV</headline>
        <description>At 524 PM PDT, Doppler radar was tracking a thunderstorm outflow
boundary near Pyramid Lake, moving south at 15 mph.

HAZARD...Wind gusts up to 50 mph.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Gusty winds could create sudden increases to wave heights
with hazardous boating conditions.

Locations impacted include...
Pyramid Lake, Sutcliffe, Nixon, and The Needle Rocks.
</description>
        <instruction>If outdoors, consider seeking shelter inside a building.

If on or near Pyramid Lake, get out of the water and move indoors or
inside a vehicle.</instruction>
